# Lanternfold: a shadow-puppet world of paper cut-outs, lit by one great lantern. A storybook tale,
# warm amber. D minor, 72 bpm. A small reed sings the tale over a harp.

title Lanternfold
tempo 72
beats 4
steps 2
seed  139

voice pad   kind=pad   octave=4  gain=0.38  reverb=0.55
